trong\">Vanessa</span>: It's possible that it isn't the lamp that needs fixing.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: I am not in the mood for another snarky remark from either of you.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I am suggesting that maybe it's the entire building that needs rewiring! Maybe you are wasting time. Besides didn't you buy those lamps when you moved in?\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>:  They are fairly new but I thought they might both be on the blink."}, {"time": "62000", "image": "engenn9le01ob03re2img01.jpg", "id": 3, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: I guess one possible solution is to  plug something else in. Then we'll see if it works.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Really? I swear, you must think I'm a total dud! I plugged in the toaster this morning to test out the sockets.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I think we need to take a break and have a little lunch. Peter, you might be getting testy because you're hungry.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: It's not that. There is so much that needs to be fixed around here that I am overwhelmed!"}]}}], "template_override": 1, "title": "", "type": "audio", "id": 1, "_data": []}], "id": 0, "_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"type": "has_nav", "content": true}, {"type": "has_exercise_controls", "content": true}]}]}]}